  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Les défis de la diversité culturelle dans le monde du travail au XXIe siècle (2020), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has no recorded citations, downloads or public discussion yet. This is an early record rather than a quiet one — the signals collected for it so far are thin.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Les défis de la diversité culturelle dans le monde du travail au XXIe siècle by Ariane Le Moing, Saïd Ouaked and Christèle Le Bihan was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2020. It is part of the Travail et Société / Work and Society series. Conceptually, the work connects to Art.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It is recorded in 4 library collections. Its subject matter aligns with Reduced inequalities among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
